WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Every pot. One clear view.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start a focused comparison.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Select Pot 62. Follow its moisture history.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Add Pot 64. Compare the individual traces.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Add a drought pot. See the different response.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Remove a trace to simplify the comparison.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Open Pot 62 for readings, targets, and sensor details.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Inspect a timestamp and its measured value.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Check the raw signal, calibration, and recorded valve events.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Return to the traces with your comparison intact.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Bring every pot back into view.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Review recorded watering alongside soil moisture.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Explore the safe sample workspace at exacth2o.com/demo.
